=== fetch-misty-rainforest-finds-surveil-land
title: Misty Rainforest (Forest or Island) fetches Hedge Maze, which enters tapped and surveils
ref: Misty Rainforest Oracle; Hedge Maze Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Misty Rainforest
  humanlibrary=Hedge Maze;Island;Island
script:
  p1: activate Misty Rainforest
  p1: pick Hedge Maze
  p1: pick Island
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
expect:
  controls p1 "Hedge Maze"
  tapped p1 "Hedge Maze"
  zone p1 graveyard has "Island"

