=== preordain-scry-two-draw-one
title: Preordain scries 2 (one to the bottom) then draws a card
ref: Preordain Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Preordain
  humanbattlefield=Island
  humanlibrary=Island;Brainstorm;Ponder;Island
script:
  p1: cast Preordain
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
  p1: pick Island
expect:
  zone p1 hand has "Brainstorm"
  zone p1 hand size == 1

=== erode-destroys-and-gives-basic
title: Erode destroys a creature and its controller may search for a basic land, put onto the battlefield tapped
ref: Erode Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Erode
  humanbattlefield=Plains
  aibattlefield=Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd
  ailibrary=Island;Island;Island
script:
  p1: cast Erode -> Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
expect:
  zone p2 graveyard has "Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd"
  zone p2 battlefield count "Island" == 1
  tapped p2 "Island"

=== bilbo-escape-costs-one-less
title: Bilbo makes spells cast from outside your hand cost {1} less: Nethergoyf escape costs {1}{B}
ref: Bilbo, Thief in the Night Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Bilbo, Thief in the Night;Swamp;Swamp
  humangraveyard=Nethergoyf;Island;Fatal Push;Orcish Bowmasters;Mishra's Bauble
script:
  p1: cast Nethergoyf ~escape
  p1: pick Island;Fatal Push;Orcish Bowmasters;Mishra's Bauble
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
expect:
  controls p1 "Nethergoyf"

=== bilbo-attack-casts-instant-from-graveyard
title: Bilbo attacking lets you cast an instant from the graveyard (reduced by 1) and exile it afterwards
ref: Bilbo, Thief in the Night Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Bilbo, Thief in the Night;Island
  humangraveyard=Flow State
  humanlibrary=Brainstorm;Ponder;Island;Island;Island
script:
  p1: at COMBAT_BEGIN
  p1: attack Bilbo, Thief in the Night -> p2
  p1: pick yes
  p1: pick Flow State
  p1: pick play
  p1: pick Brainstorm
expect:
  zone p1 exile has "Flow State"
  zone p1 hand has "Brainstorm"

=== koma-cannot-be-countered
title: Koma, World-Eater cannot be countered (Force of Will does nothing)
ref: Koma, World-Eater Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Koma, World-Eater
  humanbattlefield=Forest;Forest;Island;Island;Island;Island;Island
  aihand=Force of Will;Brainstorm
script:
  p1: cast Koma, World-Eater
  p1: pass
  p2: when-stack Koma
  p2: cast Force of Will ~alt -> Koma, World-Eater
  p2: pick Brainstorm
expect:
  controls p1 "Koma, World-Eater"

=== koma-ward-four
title: Koma's ward {4}: an opponent who cannot pay {4} has Swords to Plowshares countered
ref: Koma, World-Eater Oracle; CR 702.21 (ward)
state:
  turn=2
  activeplayer=ai
  activephase=MAIN1
  humanbattlefield=Koma, World-Eater
  aihand=Swords to Plowshares
  aibattlefield=Plains
script:
  p2: cast Swords to Plowshares -> Koma, World-Eater
  p2: pass
  p1: pass
expect:
  controls p1 "Koma, World-Eater"
  zone p2 graveyard has "Swords to Plowshares"

=== pyroblast-counters-blue-spell
title: Pyroblast counters a blue spell
ref: Pyroblast Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Brainstorm
  humanbattlefield=Island
  aihand=Pyroblast
  aibattlefield=Mountain
script:
  p1: cast Brainstorm
  p1: pass
  p2: when-stack Brainstorm
  p2: cast Pyroblast ~Counter -> Brainstorm
  p2: pick Counter target spell
expect:
  zone p1 graveyard has "Brainstorm"
  zone p1 hand size == 0

=== pyroblast-cannot-counter-nonblue
title: Pyroblast's counter mode can target any spell but does nothing to a nonblue one (Lightning Bolt still resolves)
ref: Pyroblast Oracle ("Counter target spell if it's blue": the target is legal, the effect checks color on resolution)
state:
  humanhand=Lightning Bolt
  humanbattlefield=Mountain
  aihand=Pyroblast
  aibattlefield=Mountain
script:
  p1: cast Lightning Bolt -> p2
  p1: pass
  p2: when-stack Lightning Bolt
  p2: cast Pyroblast ~Counter -> Lightning Bolt
  p2: pick Counter target spell
expect:
  life p2 == 17
  zone p2 graveyard has "Pyroblast"

=== grafdigger-cage-stops-reanimate
title: With Grafdigger's Cage out, Reanimate cannot put the creature onto the battlefield (the life loss still happens)
ref: Grafdigger's Cage Oracle; Reanimate Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Reanimate
  humanbattlefield=Swamp
  humangraveyard=Griselbrand
  aibattlefield=Grafdigger's Cage
script:
  p1: cast Reanimate -> Griselbrand
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
expect:
  not controls p1 "Griselbrand"
  zone p1 graveyard has "Griselbrand"

=== grafdigger-cage-stops-flashback
title: With Grafdigger's Cage out, Faithless Looting cannot be flashed back from the graveyard
ref: Grafdigger's Cage Oracle
state:
  humangraveyard=Faithless Looting
  humanbattlefield=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
  humanlibrary=Island;Island;Island;Island
  aibattlefield=Grafdigger's Cage
script:
  p1: try cast Faithless Looting ~alt
  p1: pass
expect:
  zone p1 graveyard has "Faithless Looting"

=== containment-priest-exiles-reanimated-creature
title: Containment Priest exiles a creature put onto the battlefield without being cast (Reanimate), but not one that was cast
ref: Containment Priest Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Reanimate
  humanbattlefield=Swamp
  humangraveyard=Griselbrand
  aibattlefield=Containment Priest
script:
  p1: cast Reanimate -> Griselbrand
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
expect:
  zone p1 exile has "Griselbrand"
  not controls p1 "Griselbrand"
  life p1 == 12

