=== faerie-macabre-fizzles-reanimate
title: Discarding Faerie Macabre (free) to exile Griselbrand in response makes Reanimate fizzle with no life loss
ref: Faerie Macabre Oracle; Reanimate Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Reanimate
  humanbattlefield=Swamp
  humangraveyard=Griselbrand
  aihand=Faerie Macabre
script:
  p1: cast Reanimate -> Griselbrand
  p1: pass
  p2: when-stack Reanimate
  p2: activate Faerie Macabre -> Griselbrand
expect:
  life p1 == 20
  zone p1 exile has "Griselbrand"
  zone p2 graveyard has "Faerie Macabre"

=== surgical-extraction-hits-hand-and-library
title: Surgical Extraction exiles every copy from graveyard, hand and library
ref: Surgical Extraction Oracle
state:
  humangraveyard=Dark Ritual
  humanhand=Dark Ritual
  humanlibrary=Dark Ritual;Island;Island
  aihand=Surgical Extraction
  aibattlefield=Swamp
script:
  p2: cast Surgical Extraction -> Dark Ritual
expect:
  zone p1 exile count "Dark Ritual" == 3
  zone p1 hand size == 0

=== deafening-silence-one-noncreature-spell
title: Deafening Silence: a player cannot cast a second noncreature spell in a turn
ref: Deafening Silence Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Brainstorm;Ponder
  humanbattlefield=Island;Island
  aibattlefield=Deafening Silence
script:
  p1: cast Brainstorm
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
  p1: pick Island;Island
  p1: try cast Ponder
  p1: pass
expect:
  zone p1 hand has "Ponder"
  spells p1 == 1
